# Physical reconciliation rules

## Intent lifecycle

`PLANNED → READY → MATERIALIZING → MATERIALIZED`
Also: `BLOCKED`, `FAILED_RETRYABLE` (bounded retries), `FAILED_TERMINAL`, `SUPERSEDED`, `REMOVED`

Status is explicit on the intent record — never infer from missing map entries.

## Intent categories (`PhysicalIntentType`)

| Category | Types | Consumer |
|----------|-------|----------|
| Persistent geometry | CONSTRUCT_BUILDING, EXTEND_ROAD, BUILD_BRIDGE, BUILD_WALL, BUILD_GATE, REPAIR/DAMAGE/DESTROY_STRUCTURE, CREATE_RUIN, CREATE_RESOURCE_SITE, CREATE_BANDIT_CAMP, UPGRADE_BANDIT_CAMP, REMOVE_BANDIT_CAMP, CREATE_FORTIFICATION, SIEGE_DAMAGE | `PhysicalReconciliationEngine` materializers |
| Planning meta | EXPAND_SETTLEMENT, CREATE_DISTRICT, FOUND_PLAYER_SETTLEMENT | `DynamicUrbanPlanner` → child intents; never one giant building |
| Transient projection | PROJECT_CARAVAN, PROJECT_ARMY, PROJECT_GUARDS, PROJECT_REFUGEES, PROJECT_MIGRANTS | Interest binders — never block-slice success |

Exhaustive switch in `materializeSlice()` — no `default -> true`.

## Realization constraints

- Chunk-local slices; intent stays pending while destination chunks unloaded
- Canonical `pendingChunkKeys` / `appliedChunkKeys` are authority (not NeoForge process-local maps alone)
- Typed `PhysicalIntentPayload` (protocol v3) carries pending/applied slices + route geometry
- Location-based queries via `ConstructionQuery` MODE_SETTLEMENT / MODE_REGION
- Dependencies evaluated centrally in `DynamicPhysicalState.evaluateDependencies`
- Bounded ops + block-placement budget per tick
- Failures log intentId/type/settlement/chunk/reason/retryCount
- `RealizationResult` (required/placed/protected/critical/completionRatio) — partial placement is not success

## Dynamic planning

`DynamicUrbanPlanner` — terrain-aware plots, district/founding plans, road routes, walls/gates, bandit site scoring.
Culture keys via `CultureResolver` / `CultureKeys` — never kingdom UUID strings.

## Projection binders

- `CitizenProjectionBinder`, `ArmyProjectionBinder`, `CaravanProjectionBinder`
- `BanditProjectionBinder`, `GuardProjectionBinder`
- Shared entity: `ProjectedHumanoidEntity` (not vanilla villagers as soldiers)

## Provenance

`SafeChunkWriter` dynamicMode + `trySetLivingModsOnly`. Unknown/protected → replan or block.

## Outcomes

`PhysicalOutcomePayload` / `PhysicalOutcomeApplier`. Structure records only for `createsStructureRecord()` types. No `UUID.randomUUID()` for missing structure IDs.
